<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 6.45 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 6.45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped to 6.45 percent on Thursday from 7.64 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said eight banks traded on the market in 20 reported transactions with a total value of 20.68 million dinars ($29.2 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
